# ============================================
# CARA SET DI VERCEL:
# ============================================
# 1. Buka https://vercel.com
# 2. Pilih project "Pocket"
# 3. Settings → Environment Variables
# 4. Add New → Masukkan:
#    - Name: DATABASE_URL
#    - Value: (copy dari atas)
#    - Environment: Production, Preview, Development (CENTANG SEMUA)
# 5. Ulangi untuk DIRECT_URL, NEXTAUTH_URL, NEXTAUTH_SECRET
# 6. Setelah semua di-set, klik Deployments
# 7. Pilih deployment teratas → Redeploy
